sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Ứng dụng Khách
    participant SDK as FlagOps SDK (In-process)
    participant API as FlagOps Eval API (/eval/v1)
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Engine as Pure Engine (app/engine)

    Note over App, Engine: Kịch bản 1: In-Process Evaluation (Tối ưu độ trễ microsecond)
    App->>SDK: is_enabled("checkout-v2", context)
    SDK->>SDK: Đọc Ruleset trong bộ nhớ RAM
    SDK->>Engine: evaluate(ruleset, context)
    Engine->>Engine: Kiểm tra Flag Enabled & Overrides
    Engine->>Engine: Duyệt Targeting Rules & Segment Matcher
    Engine->>Engine: MurmurHash3 Sticky Bucketing (nếu có split)
    Engine-->>SDK: EvaluationResult(value=True, variant="v2", reason="SPLIT")
    SDK-->>App: True (Hoàn thành trong < 15 microseconds)
    SDK-)API: Gửi batch evaluation events bất đồng bộ

    Note over App, PG: Kịch bản 2: Remote HTTP Evaluation (/eval/v1/flags)
    App->>API: POST /eval/v1/flags (headers: X-FlagOps-Key, body: context)
    API->>API: Xác thực API Key & Kiểm tra Rate Limit
    API->>Redis: GET ruleset:{env_id}
    alt Cache Hit
        Redis-->>API: Ruleset JSON đã biên dịch
    else Cache Miss / Fail-Open
        API->>PG: Query FlagSettings & Rules (SQLAlchemy)
        PG-->>API: Entity Models
        API->>API: Biên dịch thành Ruleset
        API->>Redis: SETEX ruleset:{env_id} 300s (async)
    end
    API->>Engine: evaluate(ruleset, context)
    Engine-->>API: EvaluationResult
    API-->>App: 200 OK (value, variant, reason, flagMetadata)
